indicate whether changes were made.

The canonical legal text is at <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode>.
A human-readable summary is at <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>.

Suggested attribution: "Based on *Rust from Zero*
(<https://github.com/habtamugeta2-r/Rust-from-zero>), licensed CC BY 4.0."

